Rule 9 (input must be 3D and resulting upsampled steps must be positive)
{v_1 : int, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 3 ∧ shape(v_2, 1) * v_1 > 0
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor must not be of string or boolean type)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 3 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 11 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 0
